QUERY: rg -n -i 'stakeholder.{0,50}(invariant|relax)|ENV.{0,15}MON|observation.to.goal|requirement.{0,30}(authority|uncertainty)|DEP.{0,25}(regression|dependenc)' kb/sources/ --glob *.md --glob !*.brief.md
kb/sources/posthog-semantic-layer-2090858894419693598.ingest.md:33:This source is a concrete implementation witness for [Make Authority Explicit](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md) and [Keep Lineage And Compiled Views From Drifting](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/keep-compiled-views-aligned.md): agent output remains proposed, human approval grants authority, edits revoke it, and an insight-derived definition retains enough lineage to expose divergence. Its opening case also supports the distinction in [Parametric reproduction alone cannot replace an authoritative record](../theory/parametric-reproduction-cannot-replace-an-authoritative-record.md): several agents can generate plausible metric logic without any generated answer thereby becoming the operative definition.
kb/sources/continual-harness-online-adaptation-foundation-agents.ingest.md:41:> The right panel is the create-and-forget funnel: most authored skills are never invoked, a small working set absorbs the bulk of calls, and even fewer see success. The refinement loop therefore triages: it repairs the skills the agent depends on, tolerates regressions on unused ones, and accepts a long create-and-forget tail.
kb/sources/three-dimensions-agent-memory-store-2054246434506199529.ingest.md:40:4. **"Company knowledge" is an admission heuristic, not a governance model.** The public/internal and organization/user/secret distinctions help state what a shared store should contain, but multiplayer memory still needs explicit read, write, promotion, activation, and retirement authority as required by [Make Authority Explicit](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md). [just-a-reference]
kb/sources/the-self-healing-agent-harness-2048912026018484317.ingest.md:45:5. **Quality drops are root-cause-agnostic sensors** -- A bad response may come from model reasoning, tool-contract drift, infra flakes, prompt/context plumbing, stale integrations, or deploy regressions. The grader does not need root cause at scoring time; it only needs to trigger triage. This sharpens the cybernetics frame: sensors can be coarse if the downstream investigation loop is strong. [quick-win]
kb/sources/futrell-dependency-length-minimization.ingest.md:25:Dependency length is the distance in words between a syntactic head and its dependent. Dependency length minimization (DLM) is the hypothesis that speakers and grammars prefer orders that keep it short. The usual explanation is processing cost: in a left-corner parser, an unresolved head or dependent must be held in memory until its partner arrives. The paper takes hand-parsed or hand-corrected treebanks of 37 languages from 10 families. For each sentence it compares the summed dependency length of the observed order with 100 random projective reorderings of the same tree. One baseline lets word order vary freely. A more conservative baseline fixes order by relation type. The Supporting Information adds a consistent-head-direction baseline and a fixed-head-position baseline. In every language, observed length grows more slowly with sentence length than in the random baselines. Observed length also stays above the optimal projective ordering. The authors attribute that gap to competing desiderata, such as letting the reader recover structure incrementally. Effect size varies: head-final, case-marking languages (Japanese, Korean, Turkish) minimize less than head-initial ones (Italian, Indonesian, Irish). The authors conjecture that rich morphology makes long dependencies easier to identify. The result is conditional on the tested decomposition. The tree is held fixed and only the linear order varies, so the paper measures minimization through word order. It does not measure restructuring, such as splitting sentences. It also does not separate grammar from usage, and its texts are mostly edited written prose.
kb/sources/horkoff-gore-mapping-reflections-2026.ingest.md:13:domains: [goal-oriented requirements engineering, reasoning authority, participatory modeling, adaptive agents]
kb/sources/prime-agent-a-self-improving-rlm-harness.ingest.md:26:Prime Agent combines a persistent IPython environment, daemon-owned recursive sessions, family-scoped messaging, versioned prompt/memory/skill/subagent state, long-horizon controls, and descendant-aware resource accounting into one agent harness. The paper argues that this expressive substrate lets a fixed model construct its own information-management and orchestration strategies, then reports results across ARC-AGI-3, long-context tasks, coding benchmarks, nanoGPT, Factorio, and MazeBench. For this KB, its strongest contribution is not the headline performance: it is a concrete runtime decomposition plus a failure case in which online refinement preserved a Factorio specification exploit as a reusable skill. That combination makes the source useful for reasoning about persistence boundaries, behavior-changing-write authority, and the limits of bundle-level harness evaluations.
kb/sources/parnas-1972-criteria-decomposing-systems-modules.ingest.md:28:The paper is a primary technical anchor for [Use tests a decomposition locally; retained rationale is what makes transfer testable](../theory/use-tests-a-decomposition-locally-rationale-makes-transfer-testable.md): the two working KWIC decompositions show that execution can establish local adequacy without revealing which seam preserves the reason for transfer. It is also inherited evidence for [Localized retention pays when sparse changes have bounded impact in a matching decomposition](../theory/localized-retention-pays-where-change-is-sparse-in-a-matching.md), specifically for matching boundaries to anticipated change, while not establishing that dependency closure or regression validation will remain bounded. The rival decompositions provide a concrete basis for [First-principles analysis maps a design space before selecting within it](../theory/first-principles-analysis-maps-design-space-before-selection.md), because comparison exposes design axes and consequences that the conventional flow-oriented decomposition alone does not reveal.
kb/sources/parnas-1972-criteria-decomposing-systems-modules.ingest.md:36:5. **Change localization does not imply bounded validation** -- The source supports containing knowledge of a decision, but it does not analyze the full downstream dependency or regression-test radius, preserving the stronger note's stated boundary. [just-a-reference]
kb/sources/workspace-optimization-how-to-train-your-agent.ingest.md:47:The demonstrated persistence is within a game run, not across deployment sessions, and regression replay is diagnostic rather than reject-capable. A patch may therefore enter behavior, break older transitions, and remain live until a later repair. The ARC-AGI-3 setting also rewards rapid construction of a compact executable world model from a small action vocabulary; the source does not test open-ended software, knowledge work, longer-lived KB maintenance, or settings where predictions cannot be assigned to one typed owner.
kb/sources/claude-obsidian-second-brain-guide-2068306794116501544.ingest.md:37:As evidence, the guide supports [Files defer schema commitment until invariants stabilize](../theory/files-defer-centralized-schema-commitment-until-invariants-stabilize.md), [Knowledge storage does not imply contextual activation](../theory/knowledge-storage-does-not-imply-contextual-activation.md), [Raw accumulation does not create usable memory](../theory/raw-accumulation-does-not-create-usable-memory.md), [Activate Behavior-Changing Memory Before The Mistake](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/activate-behavior-changing-memory.md), [Make Authority Explicit](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md), and [Skills are instructions plus routing and execution policy](../theory/skills-are-instructions-plus-routing-and-execution-policy.md). It adds little new theory, but it is a compact adoption-facing instance of those mechanisms.
kb/sources/claude-obsidian-second-brain-guide-2068306794116501544.ingest.md:43:3. **"Keys, not prompts" is a strong authority heuristic.** The phrase is a concise practitioner rendering of [Make Authority Explicit](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md): if the agent technically can delete, send, or mutate, prompt text is not the control boundary. [quick-win]
kb/sources/symbolic-learning-enables-self-evolving-agents.ingest.md:56:The connectionist vocabulary is analogy, not mechanism: textual “gradients” are LLM critiques without differentiability, direction guarantees, or a demonstrated credit-assignment advantage over other structured reflection. The same prompted loss participates in producing updates and deciding rollback, so correlated evaluator error can admit flattering changes; no independent held-out regression suite bounds the validation radius. Standard-benchmark experiments disable tools, the software study has only five tasks with coarse author-defined scores, and creative writing is judged by GPT-4. The paper reports proof-of-concept offline optimization rather than durable learning after deployment, despite its “self-evolving in the wild” framing. It also does not ablate prompt, tool, topology, backward propagation, retry, and rollback contributions separately, so the source supports whole-harness editability more strongly than it supports the proposed backpropagation analogy.
kb/sources/four-dark-corners-requirements-engineering.ingest.md:56:Review [Exact implementation does not validate a requirement against its objective](../theory/exact-implementation-does-not-validate-a-requirement.md) for a bounded addition distinguishing the S-plus-K-to-R satisfaction obligation from informal validation of K and R, while preserving its separate requirement–objective and authority questions.
kb/sources/requirements-aware-systems-research-agenda.ingest.md:38:3. **The effective update space includes goal operations but excludes most adaptation machinery** -- The proposed primitives can add, delete, or replace requirements and goals, reassign agents, choose alternatives, relax satisfaction, and trigger component reconfiguration. The goal language and meta-model, sensed variables, monitoring boundary, valid component set, transformation library, requirements-to-architecture semantics, uncertainty formalism, decision procedure, and explanation policy remain designer-supplied; the paper gives no mechanism for learning or replacing them from outcomes. [deep-dive]
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:13:domains: [requirements-engineering, environmental-uncertainty, self-adaptive-systems, fuzzy-temporal-logic]
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:27:RELAX extends structured natural-language requirements with operators expressing permitted temporal, quantitative, and alternative behavior under uncertainty. Requirements engineers distinguish invariants from requirements that stakeholders permit the system to relax, then specify relevant environmental properties (ENV), observable monitors (MON), their relationship (REL), and requirement dependencies (DEP). Fuzzy branching temporal logic gives semantics to expressions such as “as early as possible” without enumerating every permitted adaptation. Applying the process to an assisted-living concept document illustrates how incomplete sensing can force weaker requirements and propagate effects to dependent goals. The contribution is a language and analysis process for bounding adaptation, not an implemented controller, evidence of better health outcomes, or a mechanism for autonomously revising the authority that sets those bounds.
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:41:It also clarifies the authority boundary in [Revising an improvement objective is licensed from outside it or is not improvement](../theory/revising-an-improvement-objective-is-licensed-from-outside-it.md). Stakeholders, aided by requirements engineers, decide the invariant/relaxable boundary; runtime trade-offs are licensed within that boundary. This is not a demonstration that a system can ratify a replacement terminal purpose. RELAX's “relaxation” means permitted variation in requirement satisfaction, not replacement of a component or removal of its specification.
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:45:The source's adaptation mechanism is declarative permission: runtime machinery may choose behavior within specified flexibilities rather than select only from enumerated alternatives. RELAX itself does not supply that machinery. ENV/MON/REL separate what matters in the world from what can be observed and inferred; DEP records consequences for other requirements. These are useful stated objects for inspecting adaptation, but their existence does not establish learning.
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:47:Against the [theory-builder definition](../theory/definitions/theory-builder.md), the evidence differs by condition. **Localized content:** the paper supplies identifiable requirements and associated uncertainty factors. **Consumption:** the intended runtime system would use their content to constrain adaptation, but the case study does not demonstrate such execution. **Content-directed criticism:** the authors' engineering analysis questions whether requirements remain satisfiable under incomplete sensing and revises their wording; it does not demonstrate an autonomous process that criticizes its own requirements or sensing assumptions. **Iteration:** the design process carries dependency consequences into further requirement changes, providing an illustrative human analysis sequence; no runtime sequence retaining criticism and using it in later rounds is evaluated. Specification artifacts retain design decisions, but persistence of runtime learning across episodes, runs, or problems is not shown.
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:49:Our interpretation is therefore that RELAX supplies material an engineering process could consume and criticize, not a demonstrated autonomous theory builder. It does not measure improved capacity for future action. Nor does non-enumerative adaptation remove fixed boundaries: the requirement vocabulary, chosen invariants, and monitored properties still delimit what the proposed controller can recognize and pursue. [Learning inside a fixed decomposition inherits its mistakes](../theory/learning-inside-a-fixed-decomposition-inherits-its-mistakes.md) supplies the relevant caution: freedom within permitted satisfaction dimensions is not evidence for the adequacy of those dimensions. Whether a runtime system can discover and repair an inadequate ENV–MON relationship remains open here.
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:53:1. **Separate the permitted departure from the authority permitting it.** RELAX gives a concrete requirements-engineering example of stakeholder-selected invariants and explicitly bounded flexibility. This sharpens the existing objective-revision distinction without treating behavioral adaptation as self-authorization. [quick-win]
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:54:2. **Expose the observation-to-goal inference when operationalizing knowledge work.** ENV, MON, and REL provide a compact inspection pattern: name the property of interest, the observable signal, and the inference connecting them. In an agent-operated KB, a validator result would be an observation, not automatically the quality property it is used to assess. That transfer is a proposed use of the source's distinction, not a tested KB result. [experiment]
kb/sources/relax-uncertainty-self-adaptive-systems.ingest.md:64:The ENV/MON distinction diagnoses potentially insufficient sensing but does not guarantee a correct inference from observations to environmental state. The paper assumes known physical sensors at the software-requirements stage, although its case study also motivates additional sensing technologies. It neither implements automatic discovery of missing observations nor tests revision of the requirements representation. Transfer to agent-operated knowledge work remains an analogy requiring a local test, not evidence that physical sensing and knowledge-quality assessment have interchangeable failure modes.

EXIT: 0
